# 12. Important Constraints

Do NOT simply generate an accessibility report.

**Actually modify the source code and implement the fixes.**

Do not blindly add:

```tsx
aria-label
role
tabIndex
```

to everything.

First determine whether proper semantic HTML solves the problem.

Do not claim WCAG compliance solely because automated accessibility tests pass. Automated testing cannot identify every accessibility problem.

Do not modify functionality merely to satisfy a scanner.

For every change, preserve existing application behavior.

